### REST Client (VS Code). Ubah baseUrl / kunci sesuai kebutuhan.
@baseUrl = https://lingogo.stei.site/api
# uji lokal: @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@apiKey = ISI_API_KEY
@email = demo@lingogo.stei.site
@password = ISI_PASSWORD_DEMO

### 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login -> salin token ke variabel di bawah
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Preferensi pengguna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ui_language": "id", "pron_style": "id", "target_language": "de_DE" }

### 4. Bahasa (X-API-Key, untuk kelompok lain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages?ui=id
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Bahasa di destinasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/destinations/CH/languages?ui=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5b. Nomor darurat destinasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/destinations/DE/emergency-numbers?ui=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Frasa salam: UI Indonesia, pelafalan untuk pembicara Indonesia
GET {{baseUrl}}/phrases?lang=de_DE&from=id&pron=id&category=greeting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Satu frasa: UI Inggris, pelafalan pembicara Inggris
GET {{baseUrl}}/phrases/shop_how_much?lang=ja_JP&from=en&pron=en
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
